    "answer": {
      "short": "Yes, $20$ is greater than the upper fence of $19$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{IQR}&=Q_3-Q_1\\\\\\text{IQR}&=10-4=6\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=Q_3+1.5\\times\\text{IQR}\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=10+1.5\\times6=19\\end{align*}$$ Since $20>19$, $20$ is an outlier.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
